cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this viewer or the layers it carries, cite the version of record archived on Zenodo and the paper it accompanies."
title: "Q-RITE: Qanat Shaft-Row Viewer"
abstract: >-
  An offline, single-page viewer of qanat shaft rows and the road corridors that
  cross them in the Turpan Basin, China. Five windows of about 2.5 km on a side
  carry the detected shaft mouths, the traced rows, the OpenStreetMap road
  network, the road-row crossings, and a two-click alignment comparison that
  returns the least-exposed route within a detour cap. The page needs no server
  and no installation.
type: software
